B = [
('Marshall Amplification','Europe','1960s-70s','instruments','In the style of Marshall Amplification, loud, bold, rock and roll and imposing. Matte black pebbled vinyl covers every surface, set against woven basket-weave cloth in cream, tan or black. Trim is gold or silver piping and rows of brass-toned metal studs and corner caps. A flowing white or gold cursive signature script sits on a black or gold plate, with tiny stamped capitals in small engraved type. Palette is black, cream, warm gold and chrome with occasional oxblood leather and brown. Shapes are blocky, rectangular and heavy with softly rounded edges and a stacked, monumental feel. Surfaces suggest tough road-worn craft, with bright metal glints against deep black.'),
('Samsung','East Asia','2010s-present','electronics','In the style of Samsung, polished, bright, modern and effortlessly smooth. Thin slab forms with softly curved edges and nearly invisible borders, finished in glossy glass, mirror metal and satin aluminium. Palette is graphite black, cloud white, silver, champagne gold, lavender, mint and a signature deep corporate blue, with soft gradient sheens that shift like liquid light. Small round details stand in neat clusters as precise accents. Lettering is a wide, clean, evenly spaced sans-serif in capitals inside a flattened blue oval. Clean grid layouts, generous empty space, rounded corner containers and calm, reassuring geometry make everything feel refined, friendly and technically confident.'),
('Ducati','Europe','1990s-present','motorcycles','In the style of Ducati, fast, sculpted, muscular and racing-bred Italian intensity. Glossy lacquer red dominates in broad colour fields with matte black, bright white and brushed silver as sharp counterpoints. Forms are sharply tapered, with angular facets, aggressive creases and a taut, coiled, ready-to-pounce stance. Shield-shaped badges in red, white and green appear in small crisp enamel or raised gel finishes, often with domed edges. Lettering is a stretched, wide, high-tech capital sans-serif, sometimes outlined or cut out in white. Details use carbon-fibre weave, anodised gold accents, mesh and fine contrast stitching. Racing numbers and diagonal slashes add speed and urgency.'),
('Vespa','Europe','1950s-60s','scooters','In the style of Vespa, soft, rounded, playful Italian mid-century charm. Smooth, one-piece curved shells with wasp-waisted contours and pressed-metal softness, finished in pastel enamel in mint green, sky blue, cream, coral, butter yellow and sage, with chrome trim strips and two-tone panels. A tiny wasp-like silhouette and thin flowing lowercase script appear as small tone-on-tone embroidery or embossing, quiet and confident. Textiles show pique knit, washed cotton, ribbed collars and subtle tipping in contrasting stripes. Retro enamel signs, tin tray graphics and chunky rounded forms bring nostalgic summer cheer. Everything is friendly, light, sunny and stylishly casual, with a polished retro simplicity.'),
('Royal Enfield','South Asia','1950s-present','motorcycles','In the style of Royal Enfield, honest, rugged, vintage British-Indian character. Round badges in black and antique gold carry a bold cannon and winged crest, with thin double rings, raised metal edges and a stamped, heritage feel. Colours are gloss black, deep green, maroon, cream and military olive with gold pinstripes, plus enamel red and yellow accents on winged metal plates. Lettering is a sturdy slab and classic serif in capitals, often with a rope-like outline. Surfaces mix brushed brass, nickel chrome, waxed canvas, aged leather and hand-painted lines, with chunky rivets, softly worn edges and sturdy rounded teardrop shapes. Unfussy, durable and gently nostalgic.'),
('Pan Am','North America','1950s-70s','airline','In the style of Pan Am, mid-century jet-age optimism and worldly glamour. A deep blue circle encloses a pale globe drawn with fine latitude and longitude lines in clean white linework. Lettering is bold, lowercase-leaning, evenly weighted sans-serif with generous tracking, in white on blue. Palette is cerulean and navy blue, crisp white, sandy beige, with a thin contrasting stripe in red or sky blue running along edges. Materials are glossy vinyl with white piping, canvas, polished aluminium and bright enamel. Shapes are boxy, rounded at the corners and clean, with tidy trim and flat graphic composition. Cheerful, confident, optimistic and travel-minded, with timeless retro polish.'),
('British Airways','Europe','1980s-2000s','airline','In the style of British Airways, formal, traditional pride in navy, red, white and silver. A bold swooping ribbon shape in red and blue, tapering to a pointed tip, billows like a flag in motion and works as a swift, speed-implying stripe. White fields meet deep navy and rich red in strong, balanced colour blocks, with thin silver or pale grey borders. Lettering is a sturdy, elegant serif in navy, set in mixed case with confident spacing and a quiet, dignified weight. Surfaces are clean gloss and fine woven cloth with tonal sheen. Layouts are orderly, symmetrical and tidy, with a proud, assured, slightly ceremonial and quietly premium British mood.'),
('Lufthansa','Europe','1960s-present','airline','In the style of Lufthansa, orderly, efficient, geometric modernism and strictly typographic. A deep, rich navy and a bright canary yellow form the core palette, joined by clean white and soft grey. A circular emblem encloses a bird in flight drawn in just a few simple strokes, like a seal, in blue on white or yellow on blue. Lettering is sober, evenly spaced, medium-weight sans-serif in navy. Compositions use flat, wide colour fields, a strict grid, thin rules and generous empty margins. Finishes are matte and calm with crisp edges and precise alignment. Everything feels trustworthy, disciplined, cool-headed and purposeful, with understated German clarity and no ornament.'),
('Emirates','Middle East','2000s-present','airline','In the style of Emirates, lavish, polished desert-luxury. Gleaming white grounds meet vivid ruby red in confident fields, with flowing Arabic calligraphy in red as the central mark, matched by a refined Latin wordmark beneath. Accents use rich gold, champagne, deep burgundy and warm sand beige, with soft gradients and satin sheen. Surfaces feel premium, with polished lacquer, burnished metal, supple leather and fine woven fabric. Shapes are smooth, rounded and elegant with tapering curves that echo the swoops of calligraphy. Small badges are tidy rounded rectangles in red with white lettering. Layouts are airy and symmetrical, balanced, generous and quietly opulent, with a graceful, hospitable and aspirational feel.'),
('NASA','North America','1960s-70s','spacecraft','In the style of NASA, clean, technical, optimistic American spaceflight design. Bright white fields carry bold, geometric graphics in deep blue, signal red and black. A round blue disc speckled with white stars carries a vivid red chevron swoosh and a white orbit line, an emblem repeated as patches and stickers. A second mark uses unbroken, rounded, straight-stroked capital letters with no crossbars, in red or dark grey. Colour stripes in red and blue run in parallel, with small golden wing-like details. Surfaces are matte technical fabric, glossy white enamel, golden foil and fine stitching, with neat black labels. Orderly, hopeful, precise and quietly heroic, with a cool minimalist space-age modernism.'),
]
